  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing civilian geospatial intelligence support to Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 18-months measure will make support available for the provision of geo-spatial intelligence products for civilian conflict monitoring, including to assess damages to civilian infrastructure and the environment, soils and water, or to trace organised criminal activities for example to sanction circumvention or grain smuggling.</narrative>
  </description>
